      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Where Reminders Live</h6>
        <p>Reminders appear in the <strong>right-side rail</strong> on the portal home page. They are visible only to you — not to other team members or admins.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Adding a Reminder</h6>
        <ol>
          <li>Go to the <strong>Portal Home</strong> page</li>
          <li>In the right rail, click the <strong>+ Add</strong> button next to "Reminders"</li>
          <li>Enter a <strong>Title</strong> (required) — e.g. "Call vendor", "Review report"</li>
          <li>Optionally add a <strong>Note</strong> with extra details</li>
          <li>Set the <strong>Remind At</strong> date and time</li>
          <li>Click <strong>Save</strong></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Managing Reminders</h6>
        <table class="help-table">
          <tr><td><i class="bi bi-pencil me-2"></i><strong>Edit</strong></td><td>Hover over a reminder and click the edit icon to update the title, note, or time</td></tr>
          <tr><td><i class="bi bi-trash me-2"></i><strong>Delete</strong></td><td>Click the delete icon to permanently remove a reminder</td></tr>
          <tr><td><i class="bi bi-check2 me-2"></i><strong>Complete</strong></td><td>Mark a reminder as done — it will be removed from the active list</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Good to Know</h6>
        <ul>
          <li>Reminders are <strong>personal</strong> — only you can see your own reminders</li>
          <li>Past-due reminders stay visible until you mark them done or delete them</li>
          <li>There is no limit on the number of reminders you can set</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══ DEV WORKSPACE (Admin only) ═══ -->
