      <p class="help-lead">A shared library of software, utilities, and files shared by your team. Browse, search, and download files instantly.</p>

      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Who Can Do What</h6>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li><strong>CLIENT_ADMIN</strong> — Upload files, edit and delete their own uploads</li>
          <li><strong>All other portal users</strong> — Browse and download files only</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Downloading a File</h6>
        <ol class="mb-0">
          <li>Go to <strong>Downloads</strong> in the left sidebar</li>
          <li>Use the search box to filter by name, description, or uploader</li>
          <li>Click the <strong>Download</strong> button on any file card</li>
          <li>The file is served immediately — no waiting</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

