          <li>Click <strong>Upload File</strong> in the top-right corner</li>
          <li>Drag and drop your file or click to browse — maximum <strong>1 GB</strong></li>
          <li>Enter a <strong>Name</strong> (required), plus optional Description and Version</li>
          <li>Click <strong>Upload</strong> — the file is available to download instantly once saved</li>
