      <div class="help-block">
        <h6>Editing or Deleting Your Uploads</h6>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li><strong>Edit</strong> — Click the pencil icon on your file card to update the name, description, or version</li>
          <li><strong>Delete</strong> — Click the trash icon to permanently remove the file. This cannot be undone.</li>
